              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "robinc856"
            },
            "reviewBody": "YUMMY! I made these drinks for my BUNCO group. They were a hit! Didn't know where to purchase \"Cream of Coconut\" but found it in the liquor store. Used 1/2 ounce of cr. of coconut instead of full ounce (on advice from the sales lady at the liquor store). They were wonderful! Start with 1/2 ounce of cr. of coconut and work up if you want more coconut flavor. I love coconut and 1/2 was enough for me."
          },
