            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cosmicaura123"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We tweaked it a bit, because we are island girls. We added a shot of simple syrup, shot of sprite, 1 1/2 oz coconut milk non sugar, tsp vanilla, 1 shot of sweet and sour, 2 shots of rum rather then one. \nIt took it up a notch, and wow-ser it was great, delicious!!!!",
